<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experimental Results ‣ NoiseShift: Resolution-Aware Noise Recalibration for BetterLow-Resolution Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Ablation Studies</span></a></li>
